    "title": "gravity.integration — enterprise service bus for ERP, CRM, WMS",
    "description": "An enterprise service bus with 139+ connectors for ERP, CRM, WMS and e-commerce. No-code setup, installs in 15 minutes, free to test, from 799 EUR/year.",
    "focusKeyword": "enterprise service bus, ESB software, ERP integration"
  },
  "h1": "The next-generation ESB — integrate ERP, CRM and WMS in 15 minutes",
  "decorative": true,
