        {
          "text": "<h2>Download, install, integrate — in 15 minutes</h2>\n<p>gravity.integration is an ESB with a message broker, an ESB engine and flow orchestration — free for developers, with no connector limit. It speaks REST, SOAP, GraphQL, gRPC, MQTT and Kafka with automatic XML/JSON/EDI schema mapping. Routing, retries and authentication (OAuth 2.0, mTLS) are configured visually — without writing code.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/home0.png",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "Home page — developers section",
            "width": 555,
            "height": 362,
            "wpId": 152
          },
          "link": {
            "title": "Documentation",
            "url": "https://docs.gravity-integration.com/",
            "target": "_blank"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "<h2>Replace consultants and SQL scripts with one platform</h2>\n<p>Integrate ERP, CRM, WMS and any line-of-business system without building connections from scratch. The platform supports all the popular ERPs, BaseLinker, Saldeo and more than 139 other systems — with ready-made connectors you configure visually, no programming required. Installation is free for testing and training — you'll have the environment running in 15 minutes, with full documentation and technical support. When you're ready for production, commercial plans start from 799 EUR/year, with an SLA, a dedicated account manager and an unlimited number of flows.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/home1.png",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "Home page — IT architects section",
            "width": 555,
            "height": 362,
            "wpId": 153
          },
          "link": {
            "title": "See pricing",
            "url": "/en/pricing/",
            "target": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "acf_fc_layout": "icons",
      "nav_li": null,
      "text": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Technology you won't find anywhere else</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">In-house innovations that set gravity.integration apart from every ESB on the market.</p>\n",
      "bg": "#27EA93",
      "icons": [
        {
          "icon": {
            "file": "media/ic_247-1.svg",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "Always-on-data technology icon",
            "width": 0,
            "height": 0,
            "wpId": 79
          },
          "title": "Always-on-data",
          "text": "<p>The data bus works 24/7 — even when your source systems are down. Zero downtime, zero lost data.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "icon": {
            "file": "media/Union.svg",
            "url": null,
