    {
      "acf_fc_layout": "text_img_link",
      "nav_li": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "text": "<h2 style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>One tool instead of dozens of scripts</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stop building one-off connections between systems. gravity.integration replaces SQL scripts, CSV files and manual exports with a single, manageable data bus. Less code, fewer errors, full control.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/use1-scaled.png",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "",
            "width": 2560,
            "height": 1429,
            "wpId": 411
          },
          "link": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "<h2 style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Connect every system — ERP, CRM, WMS and more</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Comarch, Subiekt GT, Enova, SAP, line-of-business systems, databases, APIs — it doesn't matter what you integrate. gravity.integration connects any internal or external system, eliminating data silos once and for all.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/Gravitti_FILM_02.jpg",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "gravity.integration — video presentation, frame 2",
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "wpId": 259
          },
          "link": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "<h2 style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Integrate with partners and suppliers in hours, not months</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Exchanging data with business partners doesn't have to take weeks. Plug your suppliers' and customers' systems into your data bus and automate the flow of information — orders, invoices, stock levels — as it happens.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/Gravitti_FILM_03.jpg",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "gravity.integration — video presentation, frame 3",
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "wpId": 260
          },
          "link": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "<h2 style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Full visibility and control over your data flows</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No more lost connections and forgotten scripts. In gravity.integration you see every integration, every data flow and every error. Update, replace or switch off systems safely, without risk.</p>\n",
          "img": {
            "file": "media/Gravitti_FILM_05.jpg",
            "url": null,
            "alt": "gravity.integration — video presentation, frame 5",
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "wpId": 261
          },
          "link": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "acf_fc_layout": "icons",
      "nav_li": null,
      "text": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Trusted by leading Polish manufacturers</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">gravity.integration powers data integration at companies in FMCG, automotive, chemicals and many other industries. Join them.</p>\n",
